---
/**
 * Street highlight: a chamfered Apricot block behind one key word, like a painted road marking.
 * The word keeps its own color (Ink on light sections): Apricot is never text on light backgrounds.
 */
---

<span class="relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap">
  <span
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute -inset-x-[0.1em] bottom-[0.04em] top-[0.46em] bg-apricot [clip-path:polygon(0.22em_0,100%_0,calc(100%_-_0.22em)_100%,0_100%)]"
  ></span>
  <span class="relative">
    <slot />
  </span>
</span>
